  "notes": "Version 2 (3 October 2026) follows an audit of the mathematics and executable certificates behind the paper (design/MATHEMATICS_AUDIT.md in the source repository). No registered prediction, frozen bar or verdict changed. The E5 memory-payoff study is rescored on a common held-out window; several statements are given their exact mathematical scope; exact computations are rational throughout; the text is rewritten for readability, with a new summary figure. Appendix F of the paper lists the changes. Version 1: doi:10.5281/zenodo.22337886."
